<h1>Returns &amp; Refund Policy</h1>
<p>If your order isn't right, we'll sort it. We're happy to accept returns on online orders requested within <strong>30 days of delivery</strong>, in line with the policies below.</p>
<p>To start a return, email us at <a href="mailto:support@curvdlondon.com" class="external-link" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank">support@curvdlondon.com</a> with your order number.</p>
<p><strong>Good to know:</strong> our customer care team are also trained Size Specialists. If you need any style, fit or sizing advice before returning your items, feel free to reach out. We're here to help.</p>
<p>Note that some of our products are classed as intimate shapewear and apparel, so strict hygiene rules apply. See Conditions of Return below.</p>
<h2>Your Options</h2>
<p>Every clock below runs from the day your order is <strong>delivered</strong>.</p>
<p><strong>Free size exchange.</strong> Request within 30 days of delivery. We'll send an alternative size out at no additional cost, subject to availability. <strong>You keep the original pair</strong>, and you're welcome to gift it or pass it to a charity shop so someone else gets the use of it. Nothing to send back and nothing to pay. If the size you want isn't available, you can take a store credit or, within 14 days of delivery, a refund instead, and in either of those cases the original does need to come back to us.</p>
<p><strong>Store credit.</strong> Request within 30 days of delivery. Return the item and we'll credit you the amount you paid, good for 12 months on anything in the store.</p>
<p><strong>Refund to your card.</strong> Request within <strong>14 days of delivery</strong>. Return the item and we'll refund the amount you paid once it's reached us and been inspected.</p>
<p>From day 15 to day 30, a store credit or an exchange is what we're able to offer.</p>
<p><strong>Returning part of an order.</strong> Where you return some but not all of an order, the refund or credit is the proportion of what you actually paid for the items coming back. On a two-for-one order, returning one of the two is half.</p>
<p><strong>Once a return is approved, the item needs to reach us within 14 days.</strong> Anything arriving later than that may not qualify.</p>
<p><strong>One resolution per order.</strong> An exchange, a refund or a store credit, whichever you choose, and that's the one. If you exchange and the replacement isn't right either, we're not able to refund or credit it after that.</p>
<h2>How Store Credit Works</h2>
<ul>
<li>It's the <strong>amount you paid</strong>, not the ticket price. A two-for-one order returned in full is credited at the full order value. Return one of the two and it's half.</li>
<li>Valid for <strong>12 months</strong> from the day we issue it.</li>
<li>An order paid for <strong>wholly or partly with store credit</strong> can be exchanged, but not refunded or credited again.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Damaged/Faulty Items</h2>
<p>If you receive an item in a damaged, defective or faulty condition, let us know <strong>within 30 days of delivery</strong>, including clear photos of:</p>
<ul>
<li>The defect/fault</li>
<li>The packaging</li>
<li>The shipping label/SKU and order number</li>
</ul>
<p>The tags don't need to be attached and the item doesn't need to be unworn.</p>
<p>Once approved, we'll ship a replacement in the same item and size where it's available, or issue a store credit for the amount you paid. Where neither of those works for you, we'll look at a refund.</p>
<p><strong>After 30 days</strong> we'll still look at a genuine manufacturing fault, assessed case by case, and the remedy will normally be a replacement.</p>
<p>We're not able to treat general wear and tear, washing damage, or accidental damage as a manufacturing fault. Reports made without the required images may not qualify.</p>
<p>None of this affects your statutory rights.</p>
<h2>Conditions of Return</h2>
<p><strong>These conditions don't apply to faulty items.</strong> If the item is damaged, defective or not as described, see Damaged/Faulty Items above.</p>
<p>For everything else, we'll ask for clear photos of the item before approving a return. If you choose to return the item, it must then meet the following conditions on examination. If these are not met, the return will be rejected and a refund will not be issued:</p>
<ul>
<li>The item is returned in its original packaging and condition: new, unworn and unwashed with tags attached</li>
<li>
<strong>Hygiene:</strong> due to the intimate nature of shapewear and leggings, if the item appears to have been worn directly against the skin, is soiled, or is impacted by odours or products, it will be considered a hygiene risk and rejected</li>
<li>The item is not damaged in any way</li>
<li>You have included your order information within the parcel</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>If a return is rejected on inspection</strong>, we'll contact you with photos. You can have it posted back to you at your own cost within 14 days of us getting in touch. After that we're not able to store it.</p>
<h2>Non-Returnable Items</h2>
<p>We cannot accept returns and refunds for:</p>
<ul>
<li>Items that have been worn, washed, or have had tags removed</li>
<li>Items that appear to have been tried on without underwear</li>
<li>Gift cards</li>
<li>Refunds or further store credit on orders paid for wholly or partly with store credit. Exchanges are still available on these</li>
</ul>
<p>None of this affects your statutory rights.</p>
<h2>Returns Information by Region</h2>
<h3><strong>UK &amp; EU Customers</strong></h3>
<p>In accordance with UK/EU consumer rights. To request a return, please contact our support team.</p>
<ul>
<li>
<strong>Exchanges:</strong> you may request an exchange for an alternative size, which will be sent out to you at no additional cost, subject to availability.</li>
<li>
<strong>Refunds:</strong> you have the statutory right to cancel your order within 14 days of receipt, for any reason, and that stands regardless of anything above. Once you've told us you're cancelling, you then have a further 14 days to send the goods back. You are responsible for the cost of returning them to our designated returns hub.</li>
</ul>
<h3><strong>USA &amp; International Customers</strong></h3>
<p>To request a return, please contact our support team.</p>
<ul>
<li>
<strong>Exchanges/store credit:</strong> we're happy to offer a free reshipment for size exchanges, or store credit.</li>
<li>
<strong>Refunds:</strong> available where requested within 14 days of delivery. You must return the item to our international warehouse at your own cost.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Important Shipping Instructions</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<strong>Do not send items back to the address on the package.</strong> This is often a logistics distribution centre that cannot process returns. You must contact us for the correct returns address.</li>
<li>We recommend posting at a location that can provide a proof of postage receipt and tracking. We are not responsible for returns lost in transit.</li>
<li>Please include your order number, name, and reason for return on a piece of paper inside the package.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Processing Times for Returns</h2>
<p>Our aim is to process returns as quickly as possible.</p>
<ul>
<li>
<strong>Physical returns:</strong> once your return has been received and inspected at our warehouse, please allow up to 10 business days for the return to be processed.</li>
<li>
<strong>Refunds:</strong> please allow up to 5 days for refunds, where applicable, to appear on your original payment method.</li>
<li>
<strong>Store credit:</strong> issued as soon as your return has been received and approved.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Reduced Refund &amp; Cancellation</h2>
<p>We will always refund the original payment amount for all items meeting the statutory refund criteria.</p>
<p>Original shipping costs are not refunded unless the item is faulty.</p>
<p>If you are paying in a currency other than our store's default currency, exchange rates can fluctuate between the time of purchase and refund.</p>
